BEHAVIOR starts-with

DESCRIPTION
  1 if the null-terminated string s begins with the null-terminated prefix,
  else 0. Byte-by-byte (not unicode-aware).

CONTRACT
  INPUT s bytes 65536
  INPUT prefix bytes 256
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 1c7d1e14

IMPLEMENTATION
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    pc = LOAD prefix 1 i
    pcz = IEQ pc 0 1
    BRANCH pcz allmatch compare

  LABEL compare
    sc = LOAD s 1 i
    eq = IEQ sc pc 1
    BRANCH eq advance mismatch

  LABEL advance
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL mismatch
    STORE result 0 8
    JUMP done

  LABEL allmatch
    STORE result 1 8

  LABEL done
END
